---
---
<div
  data-gdpr-card
  class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-neon-violet/25 bg-surface/85 p-6 backdrop-blur-md"
>
  <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
    <div>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-neon-violet">CONFORMITÉ RGPD &amp; CONTINUITÉ</span>
      <h3 class="mt-1 font-sans text-lg font-bold text-white">
        Privacy by Design &amp; Procédures IT
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
        Structurer l'existant, poser les bonnes questions aux équipes métiers et transformer un état des lieux en actions priorisées.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cadenas SVG qui se verrouille au scroll -->
    <div class="shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-neon-violet/30 bg-black/40 p-3">
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 64 64"
        class="size-12 text-neon-violet"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="3.5"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-label="Cadenas RGPD"
      >
        <path
          data-lock-shackle
          d="M20 28V18a12 12 0 0 1 24 0v10"
          style="transform: translateY(-7px);"
        />
        <rect x="14" y="28" width="36" height="26" rx="5" fill="#0b0e1a" />
        <circle cx="32" cy="41" r="3" fill="currentColor" />
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
    <li class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-black/30 px-3 py-2">
      <span>1. Zéro requête tierce (Polices locales)</span>
      <span class="text-ok">ACTIF</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-black/30 px-3 py-2">
      <span>2. Processus Arrivée / Départ (Onboarding/Offboarding)</span>
      <span class="text-ok">FORMALISÉ</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-black/30 px-3 py-2">
      <span>3. Vérification Backups &amp; Dépendances de reprise</span>
      <span class="text-ok">CONTRÔLÉ</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-black/30 px-3 py-2">
      <span>4. Diagnostic d'incidents &amp; Analyse de logs</span>
      <span class="text-neon-violet">DOCUMENTÉ</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>